# Sprint 2 Step 8 — trim build context. test-results/ is ~500 MB of
# Playwright screenshots + traces from local dev runs; never needed in
# the production image.
#
# NOTE: tests/ and docs/ MUST stay in the context — scripts/measure-resetdb.ts
# does `await import("../tests/util/db")` and Next.js's tsc pass will fail
# to resolve the module if tests/ is excluded. The runtime cost is ~5 MB.
test-results
playwright-report
scripts/*.spec.ts
.claude
.vscode
*.md
!README.md
# DRH-1 (2026-09-19) — additional exclusions. None of these are
# referenced by runtime routes or the build.
scratchpad
mobile
nav-audit.out
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
docker-compose.yml
# Standalone output makes the build's own .next unnecessary in the
# context, but the Dockerfile builder does its own `next build` so
# this only matters when Docker is invoked from a machine that has
# already built locally.

